-- places seed — the curated St. Joseph POI set the map renders (39 venues:
-- 20 food, 19 business), as of 2026-07-15. Reproducible + diffable record of what
-- PlaceSeeder swept from Google Nearby Search, after the on-brand curation pass:
--   • dropped a campus athletic facility (Claire Lynch Hall) and heavy-industrial
--     fringe 1.5–2 km out (towing, materials/parts distributors) — not neighborly POIs;
--   • added Bad Habit Brewing (its primaryType `brewery` was outside PlaceSeeder's
--     discovery groups, now added there so a re-sweep finds it).
-- Marquee downtown venues use hand-curated KnownVenues coordinates; the rest keep
-- Google's. Photos are never seeded — re-fetched live via place_id at display time.
--
-- Idempotent: `on conflict (place_id) do nothing` so re-applying (or a live PlaceSeeder
-- run) never clobbers curated rows. Depends on 20260715000000_places.sql (the table).

on conflict (place_id) do nothing;
